# BenchmarkDotNet output when run from the repo root
/BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/

# Canonical comparison reports under benchmarks/ are tracked: the public tables (readme.md,
# docs/comparisons/benchmarks.md) are generated from them by
# tools/benchmarks/update_benchmark_tables.py, and docs/comparisons/feature-benchmarks.md cites
# the feature suites directly. These are the classes the published pages link to.
# .github/workflows/benchmarks.yml re-runs the nine that the generated tables read.
# Everything else BDN writes there - run logs, html/full-json output, scratch suites of other
# cycles - stays local.
/benchmarks/BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/*
!/benchmarks/BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/results/
/benchmarks/BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/results/*
!/benchmarks/BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/results/NextORM.Benchmark.SqliteBenchmarkIteration-report-github.md
!/benchmarks/BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/results/NextORM.Benchmark.SqliteBenchmarkIteration-report.csv
!/benchmarks/BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/results/NextORM.Benchmark.SqliteBenchmarkLargeIteration-report-github.md
!/benchmarks/BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/results/NextORM.Benchmark.SqliteBenchmarkLargeIteration-report.csv
